            <ArticleTitle>Techniques to minimize the pain of injected local anesthetic.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>250-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The process of injecting local anesthetic still often remains the most uncomfortable part of dermatologic surgery for patients. This review discusses strategies that may be used to reduce this discomfort.</AbstractText>
